n    }\n\n    // 根据记账规则 生成第三方余额结转记账数据--（贷方）\n    private LoanAccount getThirdBalanceAccountsByRule(LoanAccount rule, String direction) {\n        LoanAccount credit = new LoanAccount();\n        // 账期根据 实际付款时期（入账日期）生成\n        String accountPeriod = DateUtils.formatLocalDate(rule.getAccountingDate(), Locale.ENGLISH, \"MMM-yy\")\n                .toUpperCase();\n        rule.setAccountingDate(DateUtils.formatDateOfZero(rule.getAccountingDate()));\n        BeanUtils.copyProperties(rule, credit);\n        credit.setAccountPeriod(accountPeriod);\n        if (rule.getExchangeRate() != null) {\n            credit.setAccounted(credit.getEntered().multiply(rule.getExchangeRate())\n                    .setScale(2, BigDecimal.ROUND_HALF_UP));\n        } else {\n            credit.setAccounted(credit.getEntered().multiply(BigDecimal.ONE));\n        }\n        if (LoanConstants.LOAN_GL_DIRECTION_CR.equals(direction)) {\n            credit.setDirection(LoanConstants.LOAN_GL_DIRECTION_CR);\n            credit.setSegment1(rule.getCrSegment1());\n            credit.setSegment2(rule.getCrSegment2());\n            credit.setSegment3(rule.getCrSegment3());\n            credit.setSegment4(rule.getCrSegment4());\n            credit.setSegment5(rule.getCrSegment5());\n            credit.setSegment6(rule.getCrSegment6());\n            credit.setSegment7(rule.getCrSegment7());\n            credit.setSegment8(rule.getCrSegment8());\n            credit.setAccountedCr(credit.getAccounted());\n        } else {\n            credit.setDirection(LoanConstants.LOAN_GL_DIRECTION_DR);\n            credit.setSegment1(rule.getDrSegment1());\n            credit.setSegment2(rule.getDrSegment2());\n            credit.setSegment3(rule.getDrSegment3());\n            credit.setSegment4(rule.getDrSegment4());\n            credit.setSegment5(rule.getDrSegment5());\n            credit.setSegment6(rule.getDrSegment6());\n            credit.setSegment7(rule.getDrSegment7());\n            credit.setSegment8(rule.